{"id":"n57564-2-7","stage":4,"title":"바삐 · 匆忙地","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57564-2-7-1","ko":"어딜 그렇게 바삐 가요?","zh":"你这么急着去哪儿？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어딜","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"3","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어딜","audio":"/audio/f10fe3683e3b73b1fa52.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"바삐","meaning":"匆忙地，急急忙忙地","explanation":"바삐：匆忙地，急急忙忙地","readings":[{"term":"바삐","audio":"/audio/04c7f67cc40ae3b52cd2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57564","senseId":"2","lemma":"바삐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바삐","audio":"/audio/04c7f67cc40ae3b52cd2.mp3"}},{"text":"가요?","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가요","audio":"/audio/f56d0f13cacc6a44dd26.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不确定的或难以准确表述的某个处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"04c7f67cc40ae3b5","term":"바삐","zh":"匆忙地，急急忙忙地","audio":"/audio/04c7f67cc40ae3b52cd2.mp3","entryId":"57564","definition":"极其着急地。","pronunciation":["바삐"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3b46f3ef37bcda7bb0cd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57564-2-7-2","ko":"영화 예매 시간이 일곱 시라 빨리 움직여야 할 것 같아요.","zh":"我订的是七点的电影票，得赶快动身了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"영화","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}},{"text":"예매","meaning":"预购，订购","explanation":"예매：预购，订购","readings":[{"term":"예매","audio":"/audio/b74eef2a48b6aca829ce.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22045","senseId":"1","lemma":"예매","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예매","audio":"/audio/b74eef2a48b6aca829ce.mp3"}},{"text":"시간이","meaning":"时间","explanation":"시간：时间；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"2","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간이","audio":"/audio/cecaa2f0353f97459090.mp3"}},{"text":"일곱","meaning":"七","explanation":"일곱：七","readings":[{"term":"일곱","audio":"/audio/3036db5d69be8f4dece4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70778","senseId":"1","lemma":"일곱","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일곱","audio":"/audio/3036db5d69be8f4dece4.mp3"}},{"text":"시라","meaning":"点，点钟","explanation":"시：点，点钟；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"시","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65108","senseId":"1","lemma":"시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시라","audio":"/audio/78fddd100459b98e8ff1.mp3"}},{"text":"빨리","meaning":"快，赶快","explanation":"빨리：快，赶快","readings":[{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57305","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}},{"text":"움직여야","meaning":"移动，动","explanation":"움직이다：移动，动；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"움직이다","audio":"/audio/05377c221a1ec6760c83.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58166","senseId":"2","lemma":"움직이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"움직여야","audio":"/audio/d9bbd78a3b5b26369204.mp3"}},{"text":"할","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할","audio":"/audio/3b4c012b3f82dedb34a0.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아요.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아요","audio":"/audio/d27f58354e12c6dc5616.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"b74eef2a48b6aca8","term":"예매","zh":"预购，订购","audio":"/audio/b74eef2a48b6aca829ce.mp3","entryId":"22045","definition":"提前买好车票或入场券等。","pronunciation":["예ː매"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"为了做某